<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-KALEV SETS DIVIDEND, TO ISSUE SHARES.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-KALEV SETS DIVIDEND, TO ISSUE SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian sweet producer Kalev said on Wednesday it will propose to shareholders to pay dividends of 22 kroons per share from its 14.8 million kroons net profit in 1996.</p>
<p>It will also propose a bonus share issue of 22 new shares for every existing share to raise its share capital to 78.8 million kroons, it added in a statement.  </p>
<p>Kalev will propose to assign 500,000 kroons to reserves.</p>
<p>The Kalev shareholders meeting is on June 27.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
